  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RISING III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on successful implementation of the USAID-funded RISING and RISING II projects, CAFOD and Local Partner UPO as part of Catholic Relief Services (CRS) led consortium , World Vision International (WVI), Norwegian Church Aid (NCA) will implement  a 12-month in El Fasher Rural Locality of North Darfur. The purpose of the  project is  to: i) support the most vulnerable households , particularly those with malnourished women and children, through the 2022 hunger period, ii) transition participants to resilience programming; and iii) build governance capacity and hand over RISING social and economic assets to community administrators.</narrative>
  </description>
